NET.ocf.2020","ANET.capex.2020"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $439 million in FY2025, 4.9% of revenue, against 5.9% in FY2020.","cites":["ANET.sbc.2025","ANET.revenue.2025","ANET.sbc.2020","ANET.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $1.6 billion to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["ANET.buybacks.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $3.7 billion, up 58.5% from $2.3 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["ANET.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","ANET.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $11.9 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $5.2 billion and net income to $4.8 billion.","cites":["ANET.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ANET.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","ANET.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","ANET.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","ANET.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","ANET.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ANET.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","ANET.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","ANET.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","ANET.d.opinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","ANET.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ANET.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","ANET.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","ANET.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","ANET.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $5 billion: operating cash flow of $5.2 billion less capital spending of $222 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["ANET.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ANET.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","ANET.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","ANET.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","ANET.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-09-30","ANET.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ANET.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","ANET.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","ANET.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","ANET.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topi